Warning 2 in paper.tex line 98: Non-breaking space (`~') should have been used.
DyHPO surrogate. DyHPO employs a deep-kernel Gaussian process: an MLP $\phi$ embeds $(x,b)$ into a latent space where a Matérn kernel operates \cite{wistuba-2022-supervising}. The parameters $\theta$ include GP hyper-parameters and network weights and are learned by minimising the negative log-marginal likelihood $L_{\mathrm{nll}}(\theta)$.  
