\textbf{Surrogate fidelity.} On the thirty-five-task suite DyHPO+Mono reduces held-out learning-curve RMSE by a median 18\,\% (inter-quartile range 15–25\,\%) over vanilla DyHPO and by 12\,\% over FastBO. The monotonicity-violation rate drops from $0.76\ \pm\ 0.05$ to $0.31\ \pm\ 0.04$.  
